{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18779","headline":"昏镜词 · 刘禹锡","name":"昏镜词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昏镜非美金，漠然丧其晶。\n陋容多自欺，谓若他镜明。\n瑕疵既不见，妍态随意生。\n一日四五照，自言美倾城。\n饰带以纹绣，装匣以琼瑛。\n秦宫岂不重，非适乃爲轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18779.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18779","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"常思春"}